  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Garcia and Pigpen noodling**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Unknown Instrumental x 2**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Seasons Of My Heart x 3**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Sawmill x 3**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Merry-Go-Round Broke Down x 3**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Merrily We Roll Along x 2**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Merry-Go-Round Broke Down**: back after 146 archived shows (1021 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Cartoon music**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1969-09-17.136664.sbd.Sirmick.flac16** (recommended): soundboard; 14 songs; 111 min [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says parts of the recording are dull and require patience to get through; Uploader describes it as crisp; light noise reduction on track 1 because low levels raised hiss; distortion in track 6 mostly removed [1][2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer believes a baby's cry can be heard around the 8:07 mark [3]\n- The band sounds like they are both having fun and being serious; songs are kept together on tracks to preserve flow [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1969-09-17.136664.sbd.Sirmick.flac16**: taped by Anonomous; transferred by SIRMick; source: Source: Soundboard Master Reels @ 3 3/4 IPS > DAT (44.1) [1]. Also: Provided by an anonymous source; the uploader says this recording had never circulated before [1]",
